### 12.0.10 소천체 고리3개의 채택 중심반지름·폭/극 조건

중심반지름/오차는천체중심km다.폭null은단일균일폭미채택이고0폭/물질부재아니다. 고리극은원문정적J2000모형방향이며현재세차/경도위상전파값아니다. 1pixel표시중심선은실제광학폭/불투명도/입자분포를복원하지않는다.

| 천체·고리 | 중심반지름 km·비대칭오차 | 폭 km·상태 | 고리극 J2000 deg | 원출처·한계 |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| haumea · Haumea ring | 2287 · {"minus_km":45,"plus_km":75} | 70 · published_occultation_model_nominal_width | {"ra":285.1,"dec":-10.6,"ra_uncertainty":0.5,"dec_uncertainty":1.2} | [원출처](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2006.03113) · Preferred circular-ring pole solution 1 from the 2017 event. A screen-width centerline does not represent measured ring width, opacity, color or individual particles. |
| quaoar · Q1R | 4096 · {"minus_km":10,"plus_km":10} | 미기록 · azimuthally_variable_not_one_adopted_uniform_width | {"ra":259.5,"dec":55.0,"ra_uncertainty":0.2,"dec_uncertainty":0.2} | [원출처](https://arxiv.org/html/2506.07898v1) · Simultaneous circular fixed-pole Q1R+Q2R fit to observations through 2024; possible ingress Q2R excluded. Azimuthal variations and systematic geometry differences are present; a uniform centerline is illustrative. No confirmed third ring is included; line thickness/color/opacity and particles are not measured here. |
